      "raw_full_hex": "0E000700000000000E000100010000000E000100040000001F043E043B044304470435043D043E0420000E0000000300040000EAFFFF3C0435043404430437043E04340435044F043B043E04200041042000140440044B0445043E043C043E0440044C044F040E00000003000400FFFFFFFF21000E000300000002003C000E000300010000000000"
    },
    "27": {
      "text": "<C:0000,0002,9600>Воры!<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
